! Nonrepresentational color field

```tiddlywiki
<<art worktype=`nonrepresentational color-field painting` subject=`unequal rhythms of compression and release` read=`a held interval that rewards prolonged attention without resolving into a depicted scene` imagery=`overlapping diffuse fields, one spare hard-edged interruption, breathing unpainted space` treatment=`matte pigmented planes and delicate optical vibration; no representational light source` composition=`asymmetric all-over tension with no compulsory focal center` relation=`the hard interruption redirects the diffuse fields without illustrating a literal impact` depiction-scope=`only the painting's surface; no landscape, figure, or external spectator depicted`>>
```
<<~/ahu>>

